ssage\n\n Message from the Vice-Chancellor \n\n Jharkhand\nUniversity of Technology (JUT), Ranchi \n\n Dear\nStudents, faculty members and all our Stakeholders,\n\n Greetings from Jharkhand University of Technology,\nRanchi!\n\n It is with immense pride and a sense of purpose\nthat I address all our stakeholders, including students, faculty members,\nindustry partners, alumni, and the larger academic community. As the only\naffiliating technical university in Jharkhand, JUT stands at the forefront of\nshaping the future of technical education and research in the state. With 65\naffiliated colleges under our umbrella, we are steadfast in our mission to\ncreate a thriving ecosystem for innovation, entrepreneurship, and excellence in\neducation.\n\n Our vision is to empower the youth of Jharkhand\nwith cutting-edge knowledge, skills, and opportunities that align with national\npriorities and global advancements. We are committed to fostering an\nenvironment that encourages critical thinking, collaboration, and creativity.\nInitiatives such as the establishment of Research Parks, incubation centers,\nand partnerships with industries are key steps toward bridging the gap between\nacademia and industry.\n\n The rapidly evolving technological landscape\ndemands that we prepare our students not just to adapt to change but to lead\nit. In this regard, we are focused on promoting interdisciplinary research,\nadvancing the use of emerging technologies like AI, GIS, and remote sensing,\nand advocating for green and sustainable practices in engineering and\ntechnology.\n\n We take immense pride in our role as a catalyst for\neconomic and societal development in Jharkhand. By nurturing startups,\nenhancing faculty development, and engaging in policy discussions, we aim to\ncontribute meaningfully to the growth of the region and the nation.\n\n To our students, I encourage you to dream big and\nwork tirelessly toward achieving your goals. To our faculty and staff, I thank\nyou for your dedication and urge you to continue inspiring the next generation\nof leaders. To our industry and academic partners, your collaboration is vital\nto our shared success, and I invite you to strengthen this relationship\nfurther.\n\n Together, let us build a brighter, more innovative\nfuture for Jharkhand and beyond.\n\n Warm regards,\n D.K. Singh \n Vice-Chancellor\n Jharkhand University of Technology, Ranchi\n\n Latest News\n\n Pool Campus Drive (BE/B.Tech) (Drive Date: 10th October 2026) 25 Sep 2026 (https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/QR-B-tech-Ranchi.jpeg)\n\n Pool Campus Drive (Diploma Enggineer) (Drive Date: 9th October 2026) 25 Sep 2026 (https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/QR-Diploma-Ranchi.jpeg)\n\n Interview Schedule–CrystalVision Ark Pvt. Ltd.- Date: 16 September 2026 ;Time... \n 8 Sep 2026 \n\n Notice Regarding Postponement of All Examinations Scheduled on 07-09-2026 and... 6 Sep 2026 (https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Notice-No_JUT-48_2018_Part-II_1174EX.pdf)\n\n GET- DET Recruitment -Crystal Vision Ark Pvt. Ltd. ( Only for Pass out studen... 2 Sep 2026 (https://forms.gle/qiK1ZcYbSRQsGamX9)\n\n Notice \n\n M.Tech. Admission Notice (Session 2026-28) 16 Sep 2026 (https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/M.-Tech-Notice-2026-28.pdf)\n\n Notification- Ph.D Research Scholars of JUT, Ranchi 12 Sep 2026 (https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Notification.pdf)\n\n Notice for wider circulation regarding 2nd convocation 2026 scheduled to be h... 20 Aug 2026 (https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/con-2.pdf)\n\n ENROLL TODAY \n\n TOP \n\n &copy; 2026 Jharkhand University of Technology. \nAll rights reserved.\n\n Contact Us\n\n Jharkhand University of Technology, Science & Technology Campus, Sirkha Toli,\nNamkom, Ranchi, PIN-834010, Jharkhand','a5b65c770e3c42d10d642a0d2eb5450025bc981007c35b734a220b6ee75aa7ab',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-03 11:03:37','INDEXED','2026-10-03 10:26:53','2026-10