ssionalism with hands-on training, a dynamic environment\r\n & global collaborations.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n University Institute of Sciences (https://www.cuchd.in/basic-sciences/)\r\n\n Be a future leader with a pioneering blend of\r\n academic excellence, research endeavors, and hands-on learning.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n University Institute of Applied Health\r\n Sciences (https://www.cuchd.in/applied-health-sciences/)\r\n\n Lead the forefront of Allied Health Sciences\r\n with a clinically focused curriculum and immersive learning\r\n experience.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n University Institute of Design (https://www.cuchd.in/design/)\r\n\n Embark on your journey with our comprehensive\r\n Design programs, guided by experienced faculty & tailored\r\n for success.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n University Institute of Tourism &\r\n Hospitality Management (https://www.cuchd.in/hotel-management-and-tourism/)\r\n\n Lead the way in hospitality education with\r\n cutting-edge training, facilities & a unique blend of\r\n theoretical knowledge & real-world experience.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n Global School of Finance and Accounting (https://www.cuchd.in/finance-and-accounting/)\r\n\n Unveil a revolutionary approach to finance\r\n education with dynamic experiential learning.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n Centre for Advanced Studies in Social Science and Management (https://www.cuchd.in/cassm/)\r\n\n Embrace a new era of dynamic learning &\r\n flexibility in social science and management education.\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n University Institute of Physical Education and\r\n Sports (https://www.cuchd.in/physical-education/)\r\n\n Lead the way in physical education with\r\n emphasis on fundamental principles, psychological aspects, and\r\n leadership development\r\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd)\r\n\n Doctor of\nPhilosophy\n\n Course Curriculum\n\n Explore Our Exclusive Study Programs.\n\n Back to Doctorate Programs (https://www.cuchd.in/doctorate-programs/) \r\n Apply Now (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=phd) \r\n\n Your Department in a Nutshell\n\n Achievements (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/achievements-physics.php)\n\n Activities (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/activities-physics.php)\n\n Course Curriculum (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/course-curriculum-physics.php)\n\n Research (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/research-physics.php)\n\n Labs (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/labs-physics.php)\n\n Syllabus (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/images/phd-physics-course-curriculum.pdf)\n\n Code of Ethics (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/images/phd-code-of-ethics.pdf)\n\n Plagiarism Policy (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/images/phd-plagiarism-policy.pdf)\n\n Patents (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/patents-physics.php)\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 5900+\n\n Patents since inception have been filed by Chandigarh University\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 50+\n\n Open Electives are offered by Chandigarh University\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 5 Cr.\n\n have been kept as a reserve by Chandigarh University for Research & Innovation Projects\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 110+\n\n Students from Chandigarh University have been hired by Mindtree - Highest in India\n\n Course Curriculum That Satisfies Global Education Standards.\n\n The Ph.D. programme in Physics at Chandigarh University is designed to produce globally\r\ncompetent researchers by integrating strong theoretical coursework with high-impact research.\r\nThe curriculum emphasizes research ethics, scientific methodology, and domain-specific\r\nexpertise, aligning with UGC guidelines and global best practices.\n\n Coursework Structure - PHD (Physics)\r\n\n Course Code\n\n Course Title\n\n Credits\n\n Course Type\n\n EDT-901\n\n Research Methodology\n\n 4.00\n\n Core (Mandatory)\n\n MET-902\n\n Modeling and Simulation\n\n 4.00\n\n Core (Advanced)\n\n SPS-903\n\n Seminar\n\n 2.00\n\n Core (Skill-based)\n\n UCT-904\n\n Research and Publication Ethics\n\n 2.00\n\n Core (Mandatory)\n\n All coursework must be completed within the first semester/year with a minimum CGPA of 7.5. \n\n Programme Milestones\r\n\n Milestone\n\n Timeline\n\n Details\n\n Coursework Completion\n\n Within 6–12 months\n\n Minimum 12 credits required\n\n Comprehensive Examination\n\n Within 12–18 months\n\n MST1, MST2 & End Term Examination\n\n Research Proposal Submission\n\n Within 18 months\n\n Approval by Departmental Research Committee (DRC)\n\n Progress Reviews\n\n Every 6 months\n\n Research monitoring through presentations and reports\n\n Publication Requirement\n\n Before final submission\n\n At least three publications in a Scopus/Web of Science-indexed journal\n\n Pre-Submission Presentation\n\n Before final submission\n\n Presentation to DRC and peer feedback\n\n Final Thesis Submission & Viva\n\n As per CU Ph.D. norms\n\n External evaluation + open defense\n\n Additional Academic Engagement:\n\n Teaching Assistantship (where applicable)\n\n Participation in National/International Conferences\n\n Encouragement for Collaborative & Interdisciplinary Research\n\n Training in Scientific Writing, Proposal Drafting, and Research Ethics\n\n The syllabus details for Doctor of Philosophy (Physics) can be found by clicking the button below:\n\n Syllabus (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/images/phd-physics-course-curriculum.pdf) \r\n\n You can also search for\n\n Center of excellence (https://www.cuchd.in/research/centers-of-excellence.php)\n\n CU Edge (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/cu-edge.php)\n\n Chandigarh University fees (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/course-fee.php)\n\n Chandigarh University Scholarships (https://www.cuchd.in/scholarship/)\n\n Chandigarh University reviews (https://www.cuchd.in/testimonials.php)\n\n Chandigarh University has Welcomed Students from more than 68 Countries\n\n With more than 150+ Bachelors, Masters, and Doctoral programs to choose from, CU is one of the highly preferred destinations for International Students.\n\n Explore More (https://www.cuchd.in/international/) \r\n\n A Guide to\nDiscover.\nLearn.\nEmpower.\n\n Career Guide 2026\n\n View More (https://www.cuchd.in/assets/upload/Career-Guide.pdf) \r\n\n Predict Your\nFuture Career\n\n Apply to view report\n\n Apply Now (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=predict) \r\n\n Detailed Report\non CU\nPlacements\n\n Highest Package Offered (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/)\n\n Student Placed (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/)\n\n Packages above 1.7 CR (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/)\n\n View More (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/) \r\n\n How to Apply?\n\n Step 1\r\n Signup \r\n\n Step 2\r\n Apply for CUCET(Eligibility and Scholarship Test) \r\n\n Step 3\r\n Admission \r\n\n Step 1 - Signup\n\n Sign up or Register for CUCET with basic details (Name, Email ID, Mobile No., State, Gender and Password). Your Email ID will act as your Username for the portal while the password will be set by you upon registration.\n\n On successful registration, you will receive the confirmation message on your registered contact number and Email. Use the Username and Password to Login to your CUCET Account.\n\n Step 2 - Apply\n\n After successfully creating your candidate profile for CUCET, you can proceed with choosing the Date for your examination. Complete your profile by logging into your CUCET account and choose an examination date as per your convenience and preference.\n\n Step 3 - Submit\n\n You become eligible for admission into Chandigarh University after clearing the CUCET examination. Following your attempt at CUCET, the result will shortly be intimated, based on which you can submit your application for admission and avail merit-based scholarship.\n\n Want To Become\n An Expert In Your\n Job Field?\n\n Stay Fearless And Get Ready To Conquer Your Coursework. According to the U.S Bureau of Labor Statistics, the total employment is projected to grow by 165.4 million over the 2020–30 decade, which means an increase of 11.9 million jobs.\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd) \r\n\n Apply Here\n\n CU Admissions (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/)\n\n CU Education Loan (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/education-loan.php)\n\n How to Apply? (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/how-to-apply.php)\n\n CU Scholarship (https://www.cuchd.in/scholarship/)\n\n CU Admission Office (https://www.cuchd.in/contact/index.php)\n\n CU Student Feedback (https://www.cuchd.in/iqac/student-feedback-form.php)\n\n CU Student Facilitation (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/)\n\n CU International Student Facilitation (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/InternationalStudentRequest.aspx)\n\n CU Alumni Membership (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/AlumniStudentRequest.aspx)\n\n eSanad (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/esanad.php)\n\n Guinness World Records (https://www.cuchd.in/chandigarh-university-create-guinness-world-record/)\n\n Learn Here\n\n IQAC (https://www.cuchd.in/iqac)\n\n Organogram (https://www.cuchd.in/organogram/index.php)\n\n Other Committees (https://www.cuchd.in/committee/index.php)\n\n Pay Fee Online (https://students.cuchd.in/)\n\n CU Institutes (https://www.cuchd.in/academics/institutes.php)\n\n Teaching Practices (https://www.cuchd.in/academics/teaching-practices.php)\n\n System 