ch (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/research.php)\n\n Industry Experts (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/industry-experts.php)\n\n Labs (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/labs.php)\n\n PEO, PSO & PO (https://www.cuchd.in/uiphd/doctorate-programs/peo-pso-po.php)\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 5900+\n\n Patents since inception have been filed by Chandigarh University\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 50+\n\n Open Electives are offered by Chandigarh University\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 5 Cr.\n\n have been kept as a reserve by Chandigarh University for Research & Innovation Projects\n\n Did You Know? \r\n 110+\n\n Students from Chandigarh University have been hired by Mindtree - Highest in India\n\n Course Curriculum That Satisfies Global Education Standards.\n\n Program Module/Time Line - PHD (Botany)\r\n\n Year 1 \n\n Semester 1\n\n ·         Submission of Project\n\r\n ·         Course Work & Curriculum \n\r\n 1.      Research Methodology\n\r\n 2.      Major Subject\n\r\n 3.      Minor Subject\n\r\n ·         Evaluation\n\r\n ·         Finalization of Research topic\n\n Semester 2\n\n ·         Review of Literature\n\r\n ·         Synopsis Submission\n\r\n ·         Experimentation and Observations\n\r\n ·         Progress Report Year I (RAC I)\n\n Year 2 \n\n Semester 3\n\n ·         Experimentation and Observations\n\r\n ·         Chapter Introduction\n\r\n ·         Chapter Methodology\n\n Semester 4\n\n ·         Experimentation and Observations\n\r\n ·         Analysis\n\r\n ·         Progress Report Year II (RAC 2)\n\r\n ·         Research Publication\n\n Year 3 \n\n Semester 5\n\n ·         Chapter Analysis\n\r\n ·         Chapter Conclusions and Discussions\n\r\n ·         Chapter Discussions\n\n Semester 6\n\n ·         Progress Report Year I (RAC 3)\n\r\n ·         Submission of Thesis\n\r\n ·         Presentation and Evaluation\n\n Year 4 \n\n Extension/s\n\n ·         As applicable\n\n You can also search for\n\n Center of excellence (https://www.cuchd.in/research/centers-of-excellence.php)\n\n CU Edge (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/cu-edge.php)\n\n Chandigarh University fees (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/course-fee.php)\n\n Chandigarh University Scholarships (https://www.cuchd.in/scholarship/)\n\n Chandigarh University reviews (https://www.cuchd.in/testimonials.php)\n\n Chandigarh University has Welcomed Students from more than 68 Countries\n\n With more than 150+ Bachelors, Masters, and Doctoral programs to choose from, CU is one of the highly preferred destinations for International Students.\n\n Explore More (https://www.cuchd.in/international/) \r\n\n A Guide to\nDiscover.\nLearn.\nEmpower.\n\n Career Guide 2026\n\n View More (https://www.cuchd.in/assets/upload/Career-Guide.pdf) \r\n\n Predict Your\nFuture Career\n\n Apply to view report\n\n Apply Now (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=predict) \r\n\n Detailed Report\non CU\nPlacements\n\n Highest Package Offered (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/)\n\n Student Placed (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/)\n\n Packages above 1.7 CR (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/)\n\n View More (https://www.cuchd.in/placements/) \r\n\n How to Apply?\n\n Step 1\r\n Signup \r\n\n Step 2\r\n Apply for CUCET(Eligibility and Scholarship Test) \r\n\n Step 3\r\n Admission \r\n\n Step 1 - Signup\n\n Sign up or Register for CUCET with basic details (Name, Email ID, Mobile No., State, Gender and Password). Your Email ID will act as your Username for the portal while the password will be set by you upon registration.\n\n On successful registration, you will receive the confirmation message on your registered contact number and Email. Use the Username and Password to Login to your CUCET Account.\n\n Step 2 - Apply\n\n After successfully creating your candidate profile for CUCET, you can proceed with choosing the Date for your examination. Complete your profile by logging into your CUCET account and choose an examination date as per your convenience and preference.\n\n Step 3 - Submit\n\n You become eligible for admission into Chandigarh University after clearing the CUCET examination. Following your attempt at CUCET, the result will shortly be intimated, based on which you can submit your application for admission and avail merit-based scholarship.\n\n Want To Become\n An Expert In Your\n Job Field?\n\n Stay Fearless And Get Ready To Conquer Your Coursework. According to the U.S Bureau of Labor Statistics, the total employment is projected to grow by 165.4 million over the 2020–30 decade, which means an increase of 11.9 million jobs.\n\n Apply Today (https://cucet.cuchd.in/index.aspx?utm_source=Website&utm_medium=cuchd) \r\n\n Apply Here\n\n CU Admissions (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/)\n\n CU Education Loan (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/education-loan.php)\n\n How to Apply? (https://www.cuchd.in/admissions/how-to-apply.php)\n\n CU Scholarship (https://www.cuchd.in/scholarship/)\n\n CU Admission Office (https://www.cuchd.in/contact/index.php)\n\n CU Student Feedback (https://www.cuchd.in/iqac/student-feedback-form.php)\n\n CU Student Facilitation (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/)\n\n CU International Student Facilitation (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/InternationalStudentRequest.aspx)\n\n CU Alumni Membership (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/AlumniStudentRequest.aspx)\n\n eSanad (https://www.cuchd.in/online-request/esanad.php)\n\n Guinness World Records (https://www.cuchd.in/chandigarh-university-create-guinness-world-record/)\n\n Learn Here\n\n IQAC (https://www.cuchd.in/iqac)\n\n Organogram (https://www.cuchd.in/organogram/index.php)\n\n Other Committees (https://www.cuchd.in/committee/index.php)\n\n Pay Fee Online (https://students.cuchd.in/)\n\n CU Institutes (https://www.cuchd.in/academics/institutes.php)\n\n Teaching Practices (https://www.cuchd.in/academics/teaching-practices.php)\n\n System of Evaluation (https://www.cuchd.in/academics/system-of-evaluation.php)\r\n\n CU Plac