\n Baseline\n \n Widely available\n\n This feature is well established and works across many devices and browser versions. It’s been available across browsers since July 2015.\n\n See full compatibility (https://developer.mozilla.org/de/docs/Web/API/Navigator/productSub)\n\n Learn more (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Baseline/Compatibility)\n\n The Navigator.productSub read-only property that returns either the string \"20030107\", or the string \"20100101\".\n\n In this article\n\n Value \n\n Examples \n\n Notes \n\n Specifications \n\n Browser compatibility \n\n Value \n\n Either \"20030107\", or \"20100101\".\n\n Examples \n\n js \n\n document.body.textContent = `productSub: ${navigator.productSub}`;\n\n Notes \n\n On IE, this property returns undefined.\n\n On Apple Safari and Google Chrome this property always returns 20030107 .\n\n On Firefox, this property always returns 20100101 .\n\n Specifications \n\n Specification\n\n HTML \n# dom-navigator-productsub-dev \n\n Browser compatibility \n\n Help improve MDN\n\n Was this page helpful to you? \n\n Yes \n\n No \n\n Learn how to contribute \n This page was last modified on Aug 25, 2025 by MDN contributors (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Community/Getting_started).\n\n View this page on GitHub • Report a problem with this content\n\n Filter sidebar \n\n Clear filter input \n\n HTML DOM API (https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/navigator/productsub/index.md?plain=1)\n\n Navigator (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator)\n\n Instance properties activeVRDisplays (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/activeVRDisplays)\n\n appCodeName (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/appCodeName)\n\n appName (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/appName)\n\n appVersion (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/appVersion)\n\n audioSession (https://developer.mozilla.org/en