more \n\n Deutsch \n\n English (US) \n\n 日本語 \n\n 한국어 \n\n This page was translated from English by the community.\n Learn more and join the MDN Web Docs community. (https://developer.mozilla.org/de/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorkerRegistration/installing)\n View in English \n\n Always switch to English \n\n ServiceWorkerRegistration.installing\n\n Baseline\n\n Widely available\n\n This feature is well established and works across many devices and browser versions. It’s been available across browsers since 2018년 4월.\n\n See full compatibility\n\n Learn more (https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Glossary/Baseline/Compatibility)\n\n Experimental: 이 기능은 실험적인 기능 입니다. \n프로덕션 환경에서 사용하기 전에 브라우저 호환성 표 를 주의 깊게 확인하세요.\n\n ServiceWorkerRegistration (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorkerRegistration) 인터페이스의 installing 속성은 ServiceWorker.state (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorker/state) 가 installing 인 서비스 워커를 반환한다. 이 속성은 null 로 초기 설정되어 있다.\n\n 참고 : \n이 기능은 Web Workers (https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API) 에서 사용 가능하다.\n\n In this article\n\n Syntax \n\n 명세서 \n\n 브라우저 호환성 \n\n See also \n\n Syntax \n\n js \n\n sw = ServiceWorker.installing;\n\n Value \n\n 현재 installing 상태에 있다면, ServiceWorker (https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorker) 객체\n\n 명세서 \n\n Specification\n\n Service Workers Nightly \n# navigator-service-worker-installing \n\n 브라우저 호환성 \n\n See also \n\n Using Service Workers (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Service_Worker_API/Using_Service_Workers)\n\n Service workers basic code example (https://github.com/mdn/sw-test)\n\n Is ServiceWorker ready? (https://jakearchibald.github.io/isserviceworkerready/)\n\n Promise (https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise)\n\n Using web workers (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API/Using_web_workers)\n\n Help improve MDN\n\n Was this page helpful to you? \n\n Yes