onal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n ฉันต้องการรับจดหมายข่าวจาก Google Cloud และ Workspace \n\n ลงชื่อสมัครใช้เพื่อรับข่าวสาร ข้อมูลอัปเดตของผลิตภัณฑ์ ข้อมูลกิจกรรม และข้อเสนอพิเศษเกี่ยวกับ Google Cloud จาก Google\n\n ฉันเข้าใจว่าข้อมูลส่วนตัวของฉันจะได้รับการประมวลผลตาม นโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัว (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=th) ของ Google\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Google Cloud ve Workspace bültenlerini almak istiyorum \n\n Google\'dan Google Cloud ile ilgili haberler, ürün güncellemeleri, etkinlik bilgileri ve özel teklifler almak için kaydolmak istiyorum.\n\n Kişisel verilerimin Google\'ın Gizlilik Politikası (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=tr) \'na uygun olarak işleneceğini anlıyorum.\n\n Я хочу отримувати інформаційні листи від Google Cloud і Workspace \n\n Я хочу підписатися на розсилку, щоб отримувати від Google новини, оновлення продуктів, інформацію про заходи й спеціальні пропозиції щодо Google Cloud.\n\n Я розумію, що мої персональні дані оброблятимуться відповідно до Політики конфіденційності (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=uk) Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Tôi muốn nhận bản tin của Google Cloud và Workspace \n\n Tôi muốn đăng ký nhận tin tức, tin cập nhật về sản phẩm, thông tin sự kiện và các ưu đãi đặc biệt về Google Cloud từ Google.\n\n Tôi hiểu rằng dữ liệu cá nhân của tôi sẽ được xử lý theo Chính sách quyền riêng tư (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=vi) của Google.\n\n 我希望收到 Google Cloud 和 Workspace 的最新简报 \n\n 我愿意接收 Google 关于 Google Cloud 的新闻、产品更新、活动信息以及特别优惠。\n\n 我理解，我的个人数据将根据 Google 隐私政策 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-CN) 进行处理。 \n\n 我想接收 Google Cloud 和 Workspace 的通訊 \n\n 我願意收到來自 Google 有關 Google Cloud 的最新消息、產品更新、銷售資訊、活動訊息以及優惠資訊。\n\n 我了解我的個人資料將根據 Google 私隱權政策 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-hk&gl=hk) 進行處理。\n\n 我想收到 Google Cloud 和 Workspace 電子報 \n\n 我想收到 Google 發送的 Google Cloud 相關新聞、產品最新動態、活動資訊與特價優惠。\n\n 我瞭解 Google 會依據其《 隱私權政策 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-TW&gl=tw) 》處理我的個人資料。\n\n Back Sign Up \n\n Follow our Blog (https://workspace.google.com/blog/) \n\n Included applications \n \n Gmail (https://www.google.com/products/gmail/) \n\n Meet (https://www.google.com/products/meet/) \n\n Chat (https://www.google.com/products/chat/) \n\n Calendar (https://www.google.com/products/calendar/) \n\n Drive (https://www.google.com/products/drive/) \n\n Docs (https://www.google.com/products/docs/) \n\n Sheets (https://www.google.com/products/sheets/) \n\n Slides (https://www.google.com/products/slides/) \n\n Vids (https://www.google.com/products/vids) \n\n Pics (https://www.google.com/products/pics/) \n\n Forms (https://www.google.com/products/forms/) \n\n Sites (https://www.google.com/products/sites/) \n\n Keep (https://www.google.com/products/keep/) \n\n Tasks (https://www.google.com/products/tasks/) \n\n Studio (https://www.google.com/studio/) \n\n Gemini (https://www.google.com/solutions/ai/) \n\n Gemini Notebook (https://www.google.com/products/gemini-notebook/) \n\n Apps Script (https://www.google.com/products/apps-script/) \n\n Security and management \n \n Admin (https://www.google.com/products/admin/) \n\n Endpoint (https://www.google.com/products/admin/endpoint/) \n\n Vault (https://www.google.com/products/vault/) \n\n Work Insights (https://workspace.google.com/products/workinsights/) \n\n Solutions \n \n New Business (https://www.google.com/business/new-business/) \n\n Small Business (https: