oogle Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Chci dostávat zpravodaje ze služeb Google Cloud a Workspace \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Jeg vil gerne modtage nyhedsbreve fra Google Cloud og Workspace \n\n Tilmeld mig, så jeg modtager nyheder, produktopdateringer, oplysninger om begivenheder og særtilbud fra Google. \n\n Jeg er indforstået med, at mine personoplysninger behandles i overensstemmelse med Googles privatlivspolitikker (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=da) .\n\n Ich möchte Newsletter von Google Cloud und Google Workspace erhalten. \n\n Ich möchte von Google Neuigkeiten, aktuelle Informationen zu Produkten und Veranstaltungen sowie Angebote zu Google Cloud erhalten.\n\n Ich bin damit einverstanden, dass meine personenbezogenen Daten gemäß der Datenschutzerklärung (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=de) von Google verarbeitet werden.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Quiero recibir boletines informativos de Google Cloud y Workspace \n\n Quiero registrarme para que Google me envíe noticias, novedades de productos, información de eventos y ofertas especiales de Google Cloud.\n\n Acepto que mis datos personales se procesen de acuerdo con la Política de Privacidad (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=es-419) de Google.\n\n Quiero recibir newsletters de Google Cloud y Workspace \n\n Quiero darme de alta para que Google me envíe noticias, novedades de productos, información de eventos y ofertas especiales de Google Cloud.\n\n Acepto que mis datos personales se traten de acuerdo con la Política de Privacidad (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=es) de Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Haluan saada Google Cloudin ja Workspacen uutiskirjeitä \n\n Haluan saada Googlelta sähköpostiini Google Cloudiin liittyviä uutisia ja tietoa esimerkiksi tuotepäivityksistä, tapahtumista ja erikoistarjouksista.\n\n Ymmärrän, että henkilökohtaista dataani käsitellään Googlen tietosuojakäytännön (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=fi) mukaisesti.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Je souhaite recevoir les newsletters de Google Cloud et Workspace \n\n Je souhaite que Google m\'envoie les actualités, les mises à jour de produits, les informations sur les événements et les offres spéciales concernant Google Cloud.\n\n Je comprends que mes données à caractère personnel seront traitées conformément aux Règles de confidentialité (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=fr) de Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Szeretnék hírleveleket kapni a Google Cloudtól és a Workspace-től \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Saya ingin menerima newsletter dari Google Cloud dan Workspace \n\n Daftarkan saya untuk menerima berita, info terbaru produk, informasi acara, dan penawaran spesial tentang Google Cloud dari Google.\n\n Saya memahami bahwa data pribadi saya akan diproses sesuai Kebijakan Privasi (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=id) Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Desidero ricevere newsletter da Google Cloud e Workspace \n\n Voglio ricevere da Google notizie, aggiornamenti di prodotto, informazioni su eventi e offerte speciali relativi a Google Cloud.\n\n Ho compreso che i miei dati personali verranno trattati conformemente alle Norme sulla privacy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=it) di Google.\n\n אני רוצה לקבל ניוזלטרים מ-Google Cloud ומ-Workspace \n\n אני רוצה לקבל מ-Google חדשות, עדכוני מוצר, מידע על אירועים ומבצעים מיוחדים שקשורים ל-Google Cloud.\n\n ברור לי שהמידע האישי שלי יעובד בהתאם ל מדיניות הפרטיות (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=iw) של Google.\n\n Google Cloud と Workspace のニュースレターの受信を希望する \n\n Google から、Google Cloud に関する最新情報、製品のアップデート情報、イベントの情報、および特別なオファーを受け取ることを希望します。\n 私は、私の個人情報が Google の プライバシー ポリシー (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ja) に沿って取り扱われることを理解し、私の名前、メールアドレス、電話番号、会社名、役職等の情報は、その関連会社である Google Japan GK、Google LLC および Google Asia Pacific Pte. Ltd. と共有されることを理解しています。Google LLC が所在する米国カリフォルニア州の個人情報保護規制については個人情報保護委員会（以下「PPC」）のウェブサイト内の こちらのリンク (https://www.ppc.go.jp/files/pdf/california_report.pdf) 、米国連邦法については PPC のウェブサイト内の こちらのリンク (https://www.ppc.go.jp/files/pdf/USA_report.pdf) 、Google Asia Pacific Pte. Ltd. の所在地であるシンガポールの法律に関する PPC の ウェブサイトのリンク (https://www.ppc.go.jp/files/pdf/singapore_report.pdf) です。\n\n 私は、私の個人情報が Google の プライバシー ポリシー (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ja) に沿って取り扱われることを理解しています。\n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ja) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Google Cloud 및 Workspace의 뉴스레터를 수신합니다. \n\n Google Cloud에 대한 뉴스, 제품 업데이트, 이벤트 정보, 특별 혜택에 대한 이메일을 받아 보겠습니다. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud.\n\n Google 개인정보처리방침 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ko&gl=kr) 에 따라 Google Cloud가 아래와 같이 내 개인정보를 수집, 사용 및 보유하는 데 동의합니다.\n\n I agree that Google Cloud will collect, use and retain my personal data as below in accordance with Google\'s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ko&gl=kr) . If you do not agree with this, you cannot proceed further with this request. \n\n This is required\n\n Google 개인정보처리방침 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ko&gl=kr) 에 따라 Google Cloud가 아래와 같이 내 개인정보를 수집, 사용 및 보유하는 데 동의합니다. 귀하가 이에 부동의하는 경우, 본 요청을 위한 절차를 더 진행하실 수 없습니다. \n\n 수집되는 항목: (영업 전문가에게 문의, 자료신청 또는 이벤트등록) 이름, 직무, 이메일, 회사 전화번호, 회사 정보, 국가; (뉴스레터 구독 시) 이름, 직무, 회사 이메일, 국가\n\n 수집 및 이용 목적 : 문의 처리 및 마케팅 커뮤니케이션 수행\n\n 보유 및 이용 기간 : 문의 처리 및 마케팅 커뮤니케이션 종료 시까지 또는 법적 의무 또는 제한된 사업 목적상 필요한 경우 (자세한 내용은 위 개인정보처리방침 참조) \n\n I agree that Google Cloud will collect, use and retain my personal data as below in accordance with Google\'s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ko&gl=kr) . If you do not agree with this, you cannot proceed further with this request. \n\n Collected Items: (for contact to our sales specialist, gated content or event registration) name, job title, company email, business mobile phone, company information, country; (for newsletter subscription) name, job title, company email, country\n\n Purpose of collection and use: handling inquiry and conducting marketing communications.\n\n Retention and use period: until the end of the inquiry process and marketing communications, or as necessary for legal obligations or limited business purposes (see above privacy policy for more details). \n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Ik wil graag nieuwsbrieven van Google Cloud en Workspace ontvangen \n\n Ik wil dat Google me nieuws, productupdates, informatie over evenementen en speciale aanbiedingen voor Google Cloud stuurt.\n\n Ik begrijp dat mijn persoonsgegevens worden verwerkt in overeenstemming met het Privacybeleid (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=nl) van Google.\n\n Jeg ønsker å motta nyhetsbrev fra Google Cloud og Workspace \n\n Registrer meg for å motta nyheter, produktoppdateringer, arrangementsinformasjon og spesialtilbud om Google Cloud fra Google. \n\n Jeg forstår at mine personopplysninger vil bli behandlet i henhold til Googles personvernregler (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=no) .\n\n Chcę otrzymywać newslettery od Google Cloud i Workspace \n\n Chcę się zarejestrować, aby otrzymywać od Google aktualności, nowości produktowe, informacje o wydarzeniach i oferty specjalne związane z Google Cloud.\n\n Rozumiem, że moje dane osobowe będą przetwarzanie zgodnie z  polityką prywatności Google (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=pl) .\n\n Quero receber newsletters do Google Cloud e do Workspace \n\n Quero receber notícias, atualizações de produtos, informações sobre eventos e ofertas especiais relacionadas ao Google Cloud.\n\n Entendo que meus dados pessoais serão processados de acordo com a Política de Privacidade (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=pt-BR) do Google.\n\n Quero receber newsletters do Google Cloud e Workspace \n\n Inscreva-se para receber notícias, atualizações de produtos, informação de eventos e ofertas especiais acerca do Google Cloud da Google.\n\n Compreendo que os meus dados pessoais serão processados de acordo com a Política de Privacidade (https://policies.google.com/privacy) da Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Я хочу получать рассылку о Google Cloud и Workspace \n\n Я хочу получать новости, обновления продуктов, информацию о событиях и специальные предложения от Google Cloud.\n\n Я понимаю, что мои персональные данные будут обрабатываться в соответствии с Политикой конфиденциальности (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=ru-RU) Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Jag vill få nyhetsbrev från Google Cloud och Workspace \n\n Jag vill ha nyheter, produktuppdateringar, eventinformation och specialerbjudanden från Google om Google Cloud.\n\n Jag är medveten om att mina personuppgifter behandlas enligt Googles integritetspolicy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=se) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n ฉันต้องการรับจดหมายข่าวจาก Google Cloud และ Workspace \n\n ลงชื่อสมัครใช้เพื่อรับข่าวสาร ข้อมูลอัปเดตของผลิตภัณฑ์ ข้อมูลกิจกรรม และข้อเสนอพิเศษเกี่ยวกับ Google Cloud จาก Google\n\n ฉันเข้าใจว่าข้อมูลส่วนตัวของฉันจะได้รับการประมวลผลตาม นโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัว (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=th) ของ Google\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google.\n\n Google Cloud ve Workspace bültenlerini almak istiyorum \n\n Google\'dan Google Cloud ile ilgili haberler, ürün güncellemeleri, etkinlik bilgileri ve özel teklifler almak için kaydolmak istiyorum.\n\n Kişisel verilerimin Google\'ın Gizlilik Politikası (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=tr) \'na uygun olarak işleneceğini anlıyorum.\n\n Я хочу отримувати інформаційні листи від Google Cloud і Workspace \n\n Я хочу підписатися на розсилку, щоб отримувати від Google новини, оновлення продуктів, інформацію про заходи й спеціальні пропозиції щодо Google Cloud.\n\n Я розумію, що мої персональні дані оброблятимуться відповідно до Політики конфіденційності (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=uk) Google.\n\n I would like to receive newsletters from Google Cloud and Workspace. \n\n Sign me up to receive news, product updates, event information and special offers about Google Cloud from Google. \n\n I understand my personal data will be processed in accordance with Google’s Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en) .\n\n Tôi muốn nhận bản tin của Google Cloud và Workspace \n\n Tôi muốn đăng ký nhận tin tức, tin cập nhật về sản phẩm, thông tin sự kiện và các ưu đãi đặc biệt về Google Cloud từ Google.\n\n Tôi hiểu rằng dữ liệu cá nhân của tôi sẽ được xử lý theo Chính sách quyền riêng tư (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=vi) của Google.\n\n 我希望收到 Google Cloud 和 Workspace 的最新简报 \n\n 我愿意接收 Google 关于 Google Cloud 的新闻、产品更新、活动信息以及特别优惠。\n\n 我理解，我的个人数据将根据 Google 隐私政策 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-CN) 进行处理。 \n\n 我想接收 Google Cloud 和 Workspace 的通訊 \n\n 我願意收到來自 Google 有關 Google Cloud 的最新消息、產品更新、銷售資訊、活動訊息以及優惠資訊。\n\n 我了解我的個人資料將根據 Google 私隱權政策 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-hk&gl=hk) 進行處理。\n\n 我想收到 Google Cloud 和 Workspace 電子報 \n\n 我想收到 Google 發送的 Google Cloud 相關新聞、產品最新動態、活動資訊與特價優惠。\n\n 我瞭解 Google 會依據其《 隱私權政策 (https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-TW&gl=tw) 》處理我的個人資料。\n\n Back Sign Up \n\n Follow our Blog (https://workspace.google.com/blog/) \n\n Included applications \n \n Gmail (https://www.google.com/products/gmail/) \n\n Meet (https://www.google.com/products/meet/) \n\n Chat (https://www.google.com/products/chat/) \n\n Calendar (https://www.google.com/products/calendar/) \n\n Drive (https://www.google.com/products/drive/) \n\n Docs (https://www.goo