bsite (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/)\n\n Visit the W3C homepage (https://www.w3.org/)\n\n Standards & groups (https://www.w3.org/standards/)\n\n Standards & groups\n\n Understand the various specifications, their maturity levels on the web standards track, their adoption, and the groups that develop them.\n\n Explore web standards (https://www.w3.org/standards/)\n\n About W3C web standards (https://www.w3.org/standards/about/)\n\n W3C standards & drafts (https://www.w3.org/TR/)\n\n Types of documents W3C publishes (https://www.w3.org/standards/types/)\n\n W3C groups (https://www.w3.org/groups/)\n\n Translations of W3C standards & drafts (https://www.w3.org/translations/)\n\n Reviews & public feedback (https://www.w3.org/standards/review/)\n\n Promote web standards (https://www.w3.org/get-involved/promote/)\n\n Liaisons (https://www.w3.org/liaisons/)\n\n Technical Architecture Group (TAG) (https://www.w3.org/groups/other/tag/)\n\n Get involved (https://www.w3.org/get-involved/)\n\n Get involved\n\n W3C works at the nexus of core technology, industry needs, and societal needs.\n\n Find ways to get involved (https://www.w3.org/get-involved/)\n\n Browse our work by industry (https://www.w3.org/ecosystems/)\n\n Become a Member (https://www.w3.org/membership/)\n\n Member home (restricted) (https://www.w3.org/Member/)\n\n Support us (https://www.w3.org/support-us/)\n\n Mailing lists (https://www.w3.org/email/)\n\n Participant guidebook (https://www.w3.org/guide/)\n\n Positive work environment (https://www.w3.org/about/positive-work-environment/)\n\n Invited Experts (https://www.w3.org/invited-experts/)\n\n Resources (https://www.w3.org/resources/)\n\n Resources\n\n Master web fundamentals, use our developer tools, or contribute code.\n\n Learn from W3C resources (https://www.w3.org/resources/)\n\n Developers (https://www.w3.org/developers/)\n\n Validators & tools (https://www.w3.org/developers/tools/)\n\n Accessibility fundamentals (https://www.w3.org/WAI/fundamentals/)\n\n Internationalization (i18n) (https://www.w3.org/International/i18n-drafts/nav/about)\n\n Translations of W3C standards & drafts (https://www.w3.org/translations/)\n\n Code of conduct (https://www.w3.org/policies/code-of-conduct/)\n\n Reports (https://www.w3.org/reports/)\n\n News & events (https://www.w3.org/news-events/)\n\n News & events\n\n Recent content across news, blogs, press releases, media; upcoming events.\n\n Explore news & events (https://www.w3.org/news-events/)\n\n News (https://www.w3.org/news/)\n\n Blog (https://www.w3.org/blog/)\n\n Press releases (https://www.w3.org/press-releases/)\n\n Press & media (https://www.w3.org/about/press-media/)\n\n Events (https://www.w3.org/events/)\n\n Annual W3C Conference (TPAC) (https://www.w3.org/news-events/tpac/)\n\n Code of conduct (https://www.w3.org/policies/code-of-conduct/)\n\n Support us (https://www.w3.org/support-us/)\n\n Support us\n\n Make a huge difference to our operations as a public-interest non-profit, and help us to achieve our vision.\n\n Ways you can support us (https://www.w3.org/support-us/)\n\n About (https://www.w3.org/about/)\n\n About\n\n Understand our values and principles, learn our history, look into our policies, meet our people.\n\n Find out more about us (https://www.w3.org/about/)\n\n Our mission (https://www.w3.org/mission/)\n\n Support us (https://www.w3.org/support-us/)\n\n Leadership (https://www.w3.org/about/leadership/)\n\n Staff (https://www.w3.org/staff/)\n\n Careers (https://www.w3.org/careers/)\n\n Media kit (https://www.w3.org/about/press-media/)\n\n Diversity (https://www.w3.org/about/diversity/)\n\n Corporation (https://www.w3.org/about/corporation/)\n\n Policies & legal information (https://www.w3.org/policies/)\n\n Contact us (https://www.w3.org/contact/)\n\n Help (https://www.w3.org/help/)\n\n Search (https://www.w3.org/help/search/)\n\n My account (https://www.w3.org/users/myprofile/)\n\n Making the web work\n\n The World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) develops standards and guidelines (https://www.w3.org/standards/) to help everyone build and enjoy a web based on the principles of accessibility (https://www.w3.org/mission/accessibility/), internationalization (https://www.w3.org/mission/internationalization/), privacy (https://www.w3.org/mission/privacy/) and security (https://www.w3.org/mission/security/).\n\n Read more about W3C (https://www.w3.org/about/)\n\n Working with stakeholders of the web\n\n A range of organizations join the World Wide Web Consortium as Members to work with us to drive the direction of core web technologies and exchange ideas with industry and research leaders. We rotate randomly a few of our Member organizations\' logos underneath.\n\n The Web Consortium and its members, with help from the public and the web community, focus on a range of business ecosystems that the web transforms, including E-commerce (https://www.w3.org/ecosystems/e-commerce/), Media & Entertainment (https://www.w3.org/ecosystems/media/), Publishing (https://www.w3.org/ecosystems/publishing/) and several other areas.\n\n Electronics and Telecommunications Research Institute (ETRI) \n\n Dfinity Stiftung \n\n Inrupt Inc. \n\n Rakuten Group, Inc. \n\n Netcetera \n\n EcomBack \n\n Discover how W3C supports these organizations (https://www.w3.org/ecosystems/)\n\n TPAC 2026\n\n TPAC 2026, our major hybrid event of the year, gathers our community on 26-30 October, in Dublin, Ireland.\n\n During this exciting week, W3C work groups meet to coordinate work that advances web standardization. TPAC also brings together the W3C governing bodies (Board of Directors, Advisory Board, Technical Architecture Group and the W3C Advisory Committee).\n\n Visit the TPAC 2026 website (https://www.w3.org/news-events/tpac/2026/)\n\n Web standards\n\n Web standards are the building blocks of a consistent digitally connected world. They are implemented in browsers, blogs, search engines, and other software that power our experience on the web.\n\n W3C is an international community where Members (https://www.w3.org/membership/list/), full-time staff (https://www.w3.org/staff/), and the public work together to develop web standards.\n\n Learn more about web standards (https://www.w3.org/standards/)\n\n Get involved\n\n W3C works at the nexus of core technology, industry needs, and societal needs. Everyone can get involved with the work we do.\n\n There are many ways individuals and organizations can participate in the Web Consortium to advance web standardization.\n\n Ways to get involved (https://www.w3.org/get-involved/)\n\n Latest news\n\n Latest entries from across our News (https://www.w3.org/news/), Press Releases (https://www.w3.org/press-releases/) or Blog (https://www.w3.org/blog/). \n\n W3C Newsletter - September 2026 (https://www.w3.org/blog/2026/w3c-newsletter-september-2026/)\n\n W3C President and Interim CEO Dominique Hazaël-Massieux shares timely and notable highlights and information selected from the busy and prolific work last month at W3C.\n\n Blog\n\n Consortium Members elect Board of Directors (https://www.w3.org/news/2026/consortium-members-elect-board-of-directors/)\n\n World Wide Web Consortium Members have elected seven individuals to the World Wide Web Consortium, Inc. Board of Directors\n\n News\n\n Recap of the web & AI international standards seminar: generative UI and WebSkill (https://www.w3.org/blog/2026/recap-of-the-web-ai-international-standards-seminar-generative-ui-and-webskill/)\n\n Hosted by the W3C Shenzhen Representative Office as part of the 2026 CCF Standards Technical Conference, this seminar brought together industry experts to discuss emerging technologies and standardization challenges related to generative UI, WebSkill, and web AI.\n\n Blog\n\n Crafting WCAG 3 for more accessible user experiences (https://www.w3.org/blog/2026/crafting-wcag-3-for-more-accessible-user-experiences/)\n\n In this post, W3C\'s Web Accessibility Initiative (WAI) Director Shawn Lawton Henry covers some of the stakes and challenges in developing W3C Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 3 that is under active development.\n\n Blog\n\n Home (https://www.w3.org/)\n\n Contact (https://www.w3.org/contact/)\n\n Help (https://www.w3.org/help/)\n\n Support us (https://www.w3.org/support-us/)\n\n Legal & Policies (https://www.w3.org/policies/)\n\n Corporation (https://www.w3.org/about/corporation/)\n\n System Status (https://status.w3.org/)\n\n W3C on Mastodon (https://w3c.social/@w3c)\n\n W3C on GitHub (https://github.com/w3c/)\n\n Copyright &copy; 2026 World Wide Web Consortium (https://www.w3.org/).\n W3C &reg; liability , trademark and permissive license (https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license/) rules apply.','72c23b0cac38302cf76b509874e52904bafeb291d6963c4cc32ac8585d4f9874',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-05 07:46:09','INDEXED','2026-10-05 07:41:28','2026-10-05 07:46:09'),(859,7,36,'218bd0da026f0167501452cf7294ad24958b9c5a103b47f9bd3d53e753ffae6e','https://www.w3.org/ja/','W3C','W3C \n\n コンテンツへスキップ \n\n English homepage英語 (https://www.w3.org/)\n\n 简体中文首页中国語 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/)\n\n W3Cのホームページを訪れる (https://www.w3.org/ja/)\n\n 検索 (https://www.w3.org/ja/help/search/)\n\n マイアカウント (https://www.w3.org/users/myprofile/)\n\n 日本語サイトは現在作成中です。\n\n The Japanese site is under development.\n\n Centre For Accessibility Australia \n\n Proton AG \n\n Natural Resources Canada \n\n MKR Digital Ltd \n\n ERCIM \n\n NextRoll \n\n W3C ニュースレター - 2026年9月号 (https://www.w3.org/ja/blog/2026/w3c-newsletter-september-2026/)\n\n W3C暫定CEO Dominique Hazael-Massieuxがお届けするW3Cの各種最新情報\n\n ブログ\n\n コンソーシアム加盟団体が取締役会を選出 (https://www.w3.org/ja/news/2026/consortium-members-elect-board-of-directors/)\n\n ワールド・ワイド・ウェブ・コンソーシアムの会員は、ワールド・ワイド・ウェブ・コンソーシアム社の取締役会に7名を選出しました。\n\n ニュース\n\n W3C、オープンソースプロジェクトを支援するプログラムの初のパイロット事業を開始しました (https://www.w3.org/ja/blog/2026/w3c-launches-first-pilot-of-program-to-support-open-source-projects/)\n\n このブログ記事では、戦略チームのイアン・ジェイコブスが、相互運用性、品質、そしてW3Cの価値観を支援するために設計されたプロセスや知的財産権（IPR）ポリシーを通じて、一貫性のあるオープンプラットフォームの構築を目指すエコシステムの中で、オープンソースプロジェクトが成熟できるよう支援するプログラムの最初のパイロット版についてご紹介します。\n\n ブログ\n\n W3C Japan 30周年記念イベントについて (https://www.w3.org/ja/blog/2026/a-compilation-of-w3c-in-japans-30th-anniversary-events/)\n\n W3C Japanは2026年に30周年を迎えました。その記念事業の一環として5月には会員向けイベントを、6月には一般向け展示会への出展を、そして9月初旬に会員およびコミュニティに向けてのイベントを開催しました。\n\n ブログ\n\n ホーム (https://www.w3.org/ja/)\n\n お問い合わせ (https://www.w3.org/ja/contact/)\n\n ヘルプ (https://www.w3.org/ja/help/)\n\n ご支援を (https://www.w3.org/ja/support-us/)\n\n 法的事項と方針 (https://www.w3.org/ja/policies/)\n\n 会社概要 (https://www.w3.org/ja/about/corporation/)\n\n システムステータス (https://status.w3.org/)\n\n Mastodon (https://w3c.social/@w3c)\n\n GitHub (https://github.com/w3c/)\n\n 著作権 &copy; 2026年 ワールド・ワイド・ウェブ・コンソーシアム (https://www.w3.org/)。\n W3C &reg; 免責事項 、 商標 、および 寛容なライセンス (https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license/) の規則が適用されます。','08dd589b200fd00e74d2fda7caed482907d9a32684511df3eb1e344251e8b5cb',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-05 07:46:09','INDEXED','2026-10-05 07:41:28','2026-10-05 07:46:09'),(860,7,36,'218bd0da026f0167501452cf7294ad24958b9c5a103b47f9bd3d53e753ffae6e','https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/','W3C','W3C \n\n 转到内容 \n\n English homepage英文 (https://www.w3.org/)\n\n 日本語ホームページ日语 (https://www.w3.org/ja/)\n\n 访问 W3C 主页 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/)\n\n 标准与小组 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/)\n\n 标准与小组\n\n 了解各类技术规范、其在web标准进程中的成熟度、行业采用情况以及负责制定规范的相关工作小组。\n\n 关于web标准 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/)\n\n 关于W3C发布的Web标准 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/about/)\n\n W3C标准与规范草案 (https://www.w3.org/TR/)\n\n W3C发布的文档类型 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/types/)\n\n W3C的小组 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/groups/)\n\n 翻译W3C标准文档与规范草案 (https://www.w3.org/translations/)\n\n 审阅与公众反馈 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/review/)\n\n 推广Web标准 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/get-involved/promote/)\n\n 对外联络 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/liaisons/)\n\n 技术架构组（TAG） (https://www.w3.org/groups/other/tag/)\n\n 参与W3C (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/get-involved/)\n\n 参与W3C\n\n W3C致力于连接核心技术、行业要求以及社会需求。\n\n 欢迎参与 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/get-involved/)\n\n 行业生态 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/ecosystems/)\n\n 为何加入W3C (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/membership/)\n\n 会员页面 (https://www.w3.org/Member/)\n\n 支持我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/support-us/)\n\n 邮件列表 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/email/)\n\n 参与者指南 (https://www.w3.org/guide/)\n\n 积极的工作环境 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/positive-work-environment/)\n\n 特邀专家 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/invited-experts/)\n\n 相关资源 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/resources/)\n\n 相关资源\n\n 掌握 Web 基础知识、使用我们的开发者工具或贡献代码。\n\n 了解相关资源 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/resources/)\n\n 开发者 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/developers/)\n\n 验证器和工具 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/developers/tools/)\n\n 无障碍基本原则 (https://www.w3.org/WAI/fundamentals/)\n\n 国际化 (https://www.w3.org/International/i18n-drafts/nav/about)\n\n 翻译W3C标准与规范草案 (https://www.w3.org/translations/)\n\n 行为准则 (https://www.w3.org/policies/code-of-conduct/)\n\n 团队报告 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/reports/)\n\n 新闻与活动 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news-events/)\n\n 新闻与活动\n\n W3C新闻、博客、公告、媒体与近期活动\n\n 关注新闻与活动 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news-events/)\n\n 新闻 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news/)\n\n 博客 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/blog/)\n\n 官方新闻稿 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/press-releases/)\n\n 新闻与媒体 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/press-media/)\n\n 会议活动 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/events/)\n\n W3C年度技术大会（TPAC） (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news-events/tpac/)\n\n 行为准则 (https://www.w3.org/policies/code-of-conduct/)\n\n 支持我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/support-us/)\n\n 支持我们\n\n 欢迎了解如何能为我们的公益非营利事业带来重大影响，助力实现联盟愿景。\n\n 支持我们的方式 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/support-us/)\n\n 关于我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/)\n\n 关于我们\n\n 了解我们的价值观、原则、发展历程以及政策，结识我们的团队。\n\n 关于我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/)\n\n 我们的使命 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/mission/)\n\n 支持我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/support-us/)\n\n 领导团队 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/leadership/)\n\n 团队成员 (https://www.w3.org/staff/)\n\n 工作机会 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/careers/)\n\n 媒体工具包 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/press-media/)\n\n 多样化 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/diversity/)\n\n 拓展专员 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/evangelists/)\n\n 联盟法律实体 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/corporation/)\n\n 政策与法律信息 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/policies/)\n\n 联系我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/contact/)\n\n 需要帮助 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/help/)\n\n 搜索 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/help/search/)\n\n 我的账号 (https://www.w3.org/users/myprofile/)\n\n 让web服务全人类\n\n 万维网联盟（World Wide Web Consortium，简称W3C）制定标准和指南 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/)，推动构建并共享一个以无障碍 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/mission/accessibility/)、国际化 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/mission/internationalization/)、隐私 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/mission/privacy/)与安全 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/mission/security/)为核心原则、惠及所有人的web。\n\n 进一步了解W3C (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/)\n\n 汇集web领域相关方\n\n 全球众多组织加入万维网联盟成为会员单位，与科研及行业领袖展开交流互动，携手推动核心web技术的发展。下方随机轮流展示会员单位标识。\n\n 万维网联盟及其会员单位联合公众及全球社区，专注于一系列深受web影响的行业生态，涵盖电子商务 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/ecosystems/e-commerce/)、媒体和娱乐 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/ecosystems/media/)、数字出版 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/ecosystems/publishing/)等诸多领域 。\n\n WU (Wirschaftsuniversität Wien) - Vienna University of Economics and Business \n\n Deque Systems, Inc. \n\n Sovereign Tech Agency GmbH \n\n SURF bv \n\n Visa \n\n Vidos \n\n W3C如何支持行业需求 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/ecosystems/)\n\n W3C三十周年庆典\n\n 2024年10月1日是W3C成立三十周年纪念。我们在年度技术大会 TPAC 期间共同庆祝这一重要时刻——回顾过去三十年的发展历程、见证web技术的进步、审视标准对全球产生的深远影响、展望光明未来，并通过系列专题演讲与庆典晚宴，在思想交流与欢庆氛围中度过这个具有特殊意义的夜晚。\n\n 作为W3C一年一度的重要活动，TPAC汇聚全球社区展开深入讨论与协同工作，推动各小组的重要工作进程，共同应对web当前面临的技术与社会挑战。\n\n TPAC期间汇集W3C全球会员单位代表、各技术小组、董事会、咨询委员会以及技术架构组等众多成员。\n\n W3C@30活动视频与回忆 \n\n Web标准\n\n Web标准是构建数字世界互联统一的基石。这些标准被广泛应用于浏览器、博客、搜索引擎以及其他各类软件中，为我们提供了强大的web体验支撑。\n\n W3C作为一个国际性社区，汇聚会员单位 (https://www.w3.org/membership/list/)、全职员工 (https://www.w3.org/staff/)与公众力量，携手制定web技术标准。\n\n 了解web标准 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/standards/)\n\n 欢迎参与\n\n W3C立足于核心技术、行业需求与社会诉求的交汇点。任何人都可以参与到我们的工作中来。\n\n 个人与组织可通过多种方式参与联盟工作，共同推动web标准化进程。\n\n 详见参与方式 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/get-involved/)\n\n 最新消息\n\n 来自W3C新闻 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news/)、公告 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/press-releases/)与博客 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/blog/)的最新动态\n\n 万维网联盟董事会选举结果揭晓 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news/2026/consortium-members-elect-board-of-directors/)\n\n W3C全球会员现已选举出七位成员加入联盟董事会。\n\n 新闻\n\n 回顾Web & AI国际标准研讨论坛：生成式UI与WebSkill (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/blog/2026/recap-of-the-web-ai-international-standards-seminar-generative-ui-and-webskill/)\n\n 作为2026 CCF标准技术大会分论坛，由W3C深圳代表处主办的“Web & AI国际标准研讨论坛——聚焦生成式UI与WebSkill”。业界专家围绕生成式UI、WebSkill及相关Web AI技术前沿与标准化方向展开深入探讨。\n\n 博客\n\n 制定WCAG 3：打造更无障碍的用户体验 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/blog/2026/crafting-wcag-3-for-more-accessible-user-experiences/)\n\n 在本文中，W3C Web无障碍推进计划（WAI）负责人Shawn Lawton Henry介绍了正在积极制定中的W3C无障碍指南（WCAG）3所面临的一些关键问题与挑战。\n\n 博客\n\n W3C研讨会报告：ODRL的未来 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/news/2026/w3c-workshop-report-the-future-of-odrl/)\n\n W3C于2026年7月在伦敦召开ODRL未来研讨会，会议报告现已发布。\n\n 新闻\n\n 主页 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/)\n\n 联系方式 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/contact/)\n\n 帮助 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/help/)\n\n 支持我们 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/support-us/)\n\n 法务与政策 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/policies/)\n\n 法人实体 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/about/corporation/)\n\n 系统状态 (https://status.w3.org/)\n\n W3C 在 Mastodon (https://w3c.social/@w3c)\n\n W3C 在 GitHub (https://github.com/w3c/)\n\n 版权所有 &copy; 2026年 万维网联盟 (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/)。\n 遵循 W3C &reg; 责任声明 、 标志使用 以及 许可授权 (https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license/)。','700d9525dd1c69e8a638b84b2337d67989624606842bc05938c9c69ce2b9254e',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-05 07:46:09','INDEXED','2026-10-05 07:41:28','2026-10-05 07:46:09'),(861,7,36,'218bd0da026f0167501452cf7294ad24958b9c5a103b47f9bd3d53e753ffae6e','https://www.w3.org/standards/','Web Standards | W3C','Web Standards | W3C \n\n Skip to content \n\n 日本語ホームページJapanese website (https://www.w3.org/ja/)\n\n 简体中文首页C