rticipation in W3C groups and events.\n\n Meet the W3C Member Relations team (https://www.w3.org/staff/member-relations)\n\n Master web fundamentals\n\n W3C Developers\n\n The one-stop place to find the information and tools you need to learn, build, and move the Web forward.\n\n W3C Developers Learn more (https://www.w3.org/developers/)\n\n Online training\n\n Under the name W3Cx, W3C develops MOOCs (Massive Open Online Courses) that help web developers increase their skills and empower them to become the next leaders and innovators on the web.\n\n Free online courses from W3Cx (https://www.edx.org/school/w3cx)\n\n W3C Developer Relations\n\n The W3C Developer Relations team ensures excellent relationships with and participation from our growing and diverse community.\n\n Meet the W3C Community Management team (https://www.w3.org/staff/community-mgnt)\n\n Home (https://www.w3.org/)\n\n Contact (https://www.w3.org/contact/)\n\n Help (https://www.w3.org/help/)\n\n Support us (https://www.w3.org/support-us/)\n\n Legal & Policies (https://www.w3.org/policies/)\n\n Corporation (https://www.w3.org/about/corporation/)\n\n System Status (https://status.w3.org/)\n\n W3C on Mastodon (https://w3c.social/@w3c)\n\n W3C on GitHub (https://github.com/w3c/)\n\n Copyright &copy; 2026 World Wide Web Consortium (https://www.w3.org/).\n W3C &reg; liability , trademark and permissive license (https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license/) rules apply.','86abe2ca2b0f82b6f261bf191b782c6b71b8cadd01b50bf57d8b57baf255e662',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-05 07:46:09','INDEXED','2026-10-05 07:41:28','2026-10-05 07:46:09'),(881,7,36,'218bd0da026f0167501452cf7294ad24958b9c5a103b47f9bd3d53e753ffae6e','https://www.w3.org/developers/','Developers | W3C','Developers | W3C \n\n Skip to content \n\n 日本語ホームページJapanese website (https://www.w3.org/ja/)\n\n 简体中文首页Chinese website (https://www.w3.org/zh-hans/)\n\n Visit the W3C homepage (https://www.w3.org/)\n\n Standards & groups (https://www.w3.org/standards/)\n\n 