cludes a professionally curated study kit to guide you from beginner to exam-ready.\n\nGet Certified ❯ (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/php-course)\n\n Share \n\n Link Copied \n\n Easy Learning with \"PHP Tryit\"\n\n With our online \"PHP Tryit\" editor, you can edit the PHP code, and click \non a button to view the result.\n\n Example\n\n <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n \n<?php\necho \'My first PHP script!\';\n?>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n \nTry it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/php/phptryit.asp?filename=tryphp_intro)\n\n Click on the \"Try it Yourself\" button to see how it works. \n\n PHP Exercises\n\n Most chapters in this tutorial end with exercises where you can check your knowledge.\n\n See all PHP Exercises (https://www.w3schools.com/php/php_exercises.asp)\n\n PHP Examples\n\n Learn by examples! This tutorial supplements all explanations with clarifying examples.\n\n See All PHP Examples (https://www.w3schools.com/php/php_examples.asp)\n\n PHP Quiz Test\n\n Learn by taking a quiz! This quiz will give you a signal of how much you know, or do not know, about PHP.\n\n Start PHP Quiz! (https://www.w3schools.com/php/php_quiz.asp)\n\n Track Your Progress\n\n Create a W3Schools account and get access to more features and learning materials:\n\n View your completed tutorials, exercises, and quizzes\n\n Keep an eye on your progress and daily streaks\n\n Join the leaderboard and compete with others\n\n Get your own avatar and unlock new skins\n\n Create your own personal website\n\n Sign Up &raquo; (https://profile.w3schools.com/sign-up)\n\n Note\n\n This is an optional feature. You can study at W3Schools without creating an account.\n\n PHP References\n\n W3Schools\' PHP reference contains different categories of all PHP functions, keywords and constants, along with examples.\n\n Array (https://www.w3schools.com/php/php_ref_array.asp)\n Calendar (https://www.w3schools.com/php/php_ref_calendar.asp)\n Date (https://www.w3schoo