udes a professionally curated study kit to guide you from beginner to exam-ready.\n\nGet Certified ❯ (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/certifications/products/go-certificate)\n\n Certified Go Developer \n The candidate has passed the exam at the Professional level. \n Verify at \n verify.w3schools.com \n Stale Refsnes \n for w3schools.com \n\n Share \n\n Link Copied \n\n Examples in Each Chapter\n\n Our \"Try it Yourself\" editor makes it easy to learn Go. You can edit Go code and view the result in your browser.\n\n Example\n\n package main\n\n import \"fmt\"\n\n func main() {\n\n fmt.Println(\"Hello World!\")\n\n }\n\n Try it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/go/trygo.php?filename=demo_helloworld)\n\n Click on the \"Try it Yourself\" button to see how it works. \n\n Go Exercises\n\n Test Yourself With Exercises\n\n Exercise:\n\n Insert the missing part of the code below to output \"Hello World\".\n\npackage main \nimport \"fmt\"\n\nfunc main() { \n (\"Hello World!\")\n}\n\n Submit Answer &raquo; \n Start the Exercise (https://www.w3schools.com/go/exercise.php?filename=exercise_syntax1)\n\n Track Your Progress\n\n Create a W3Schools account and get access to more features and learning materials:\n\n View your completed tutorials, exercises, and quizzes\n\n Keep an eye on your progress and daily streaks\n\n Join the leaderboard and compete with others\n\n Get your own avatar and unlock new skins\n\n Create your own personal website\n\n Sign Up &raquo; (https://profile.w3schools.com/sign-up)\n\n Note\n\n This is an optional feature. You can study at W3Schools without creating an account.\n\n ❮ Home (https://www.w3schools.com/default.asp)\n Next ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/go/go_introduction.php)\n\n ★\n\n +1 (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fpathfinder.w3schools.com)\n\n REMOVE ADS (https://order.w