com/collections/certifications/products/sass-certificate)\n\n Share \n\n Link Copied \n\n Examples in Each Chapter\n\n Our \"Show Sass\" tool makes it easy to learn Sass, it shows both the code and the result.\n\n Sass Example\n\n /* Define standard variables and values for website */\n$bgcolor: lightblue;\n\n $textcolor: darkblue;\n$fontsize: 18px;\n\n/* Use the variables */\nbody\n{\n background-color: $bgcolor;\n color: \n $textcolor;\n font-size: $fontsize;\n}\n\nRun Example &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/showsass.asp?filename=demo_sass_first)\n\n Sass Function References\n\n At W3Schools you will find complete references of all Sass functions with syntax and examples.\n\n String Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_string.asp)\n\n Numeric Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_numeric.asp)\n\n List Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_list.asp)\n\n Map Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_map.asp)\n\n Selector Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_selector.asp)\n\n Introspection Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_introspection.asp)\n\n Color Functions (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_functions_color.asp)\n\n❮ Home (https://www.w3schools.com/default.asp)\n Next ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/sass/sass_intro.asp)\n\n ★\n\n +1 (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fpathfinder.w3schools.com)\n\n REMOVE ADS (https://order.w3schools.com/plans)\n\n Learn more about Adventure Mode&rsaquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/adventure/)\n\n Free account\n\n Track your progress\n\n XP earned 0 \n Day streak 0 \n Spaces 0 \n League &mdash; \n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n New\n\n Learn in Adventure Mode \n W3Schools