t ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_intro.php)\n\n Learn SciPy\n\n SciPy is a scientific computation library that uses NumPy (https://www.w3schools.com/python/numpy/default.asp) underneath.\n\n SciPy stands for Scientific Python.\n\n Learn SciPy now ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_intro.php)\n\n Become SciPy Certified\n\n Get certified with our SciPy exam, includes a professionally curated study kit to guide you from beginner to exam-ready.\n\nGet Certified ❯ (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-scipy)\n\n Certified SciPy Developer \n The candidate has passed the exam at the Professional level. \n Verify at \n verify.w3schools.com \n Stale Refsnes \n for w3schools.com \n\n Share \n\n Link Copied \n\n Learning by Reading\n\n We have created 10 tutorial pages for you to learn the fundamentals of SciPy:\n\n Basic SciPy\n\n Introduction (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_intro.php)\n\n Getting Started (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_getting_started.php)\n\n Constants (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_constants.php)\n\n Optimizers (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_optimizers.php)\n\n Sparse Data (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_sparse_data.php)\n\n Graphs (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_graphs.php)\n\n Spatial Data (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_spatial_data.php)\n\n Matlab Arrays (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_matlab_arrays.php)\n\n Interpolation (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_interpolation.php)\n\n Significance Tests (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_statistical_significance_tests.php)\n\n Learning by Examples\n\n In our \"Try it Yourself\" editor, you can use the SciPy module, and modify the code to see the result.\n\n Example\n\n How many cubic meters are in one liter:\n\nfrom scipy import constants\n\n print(constants.liter)\n\nTry it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/trypython.php?filename=demo_scipy_import)\n\n Click on the \"Try it Yourself\" button to see how it works. \n\n Learning by Exercises\n\n Many chapters in this tutorial end with an exercise where you can check your level of knowledge.\n\n See all SciPy Exercises (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_exercises.php)\n\n Learning by Quiz Test\n\n Test your SciPy skills with a quiz test.\n\n Start SciPy Quiz (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_quiz.php)\n\n❮ Home (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/index.php)\nNext ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/python/scipy/scipy_intro.php)\n\n ★\n\n +1 (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fpathfinder.w3schools.com)\n\n REMOVE ADS (https://order.w3schools.com/plans)\n\n Learn more about Adventure Mode&rsaquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/adventure/)\n\n Free account\n\n Track your progress\n\n XP earned 0 \n Day streak 0 \n Spaces 0 \n League &mdash; \n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n New\n\n Learn in Adventure Mode \n W3Schools Adventure App \n\n Coding fundamentals as bite-sized lessons and challenges.\n\n PLUS (https://order.w3schools.com/plans)\n\n SPACES (https://www.w3schools.com/spaces/index.php)\n\n GET CERTIFIED (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/certifications)\n\n FOR TEACHERS (https://www.w3schools.com/academy/index.php)\n\n PRACTICE (https://www.w3schools.com/practice/index.php)\n\n CONTACT US\n\n &times; \n Contact Sales\n\n If you want to use W3Schools services as an educational institution, team or enterprise, send us an e-mail:\nsales@w3schools.com\n\n Report Error\n\n If you want to report an error, or if you want to make a suggestion, send us an e-mail:\nhelp@w3schools.com\n\n Top Tutorials\n\n HTML Tutorial (https://www.w3schools.com/h