ample\n\n Render a basic card with HTML and CSS:\n\n HTML + CSS Example\n\n <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<section>\n <h1>Welcome!</h1>\n <p>This card mixes HTML structure with CSS styling.</p>\n <button>Learn more</button>\n</section>\n</body>\n</html>\n body {\n font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n background-color: #f3f6f9;\n margin: 0;\n}\nsection {\n max-width: 500px;\n margin: 60px auto;\n background: white;\n padding: 24px;\n border-radius: 6px;\n}\nh1 {\n color: #04AA6D;\n}\nbutton {\n background:#04AA6D;\n color:white;\n border:none;\n padding:10px 18px;\n border-radius:4px;\n}\n \nTry it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/htmlcss/tryit.asp?filename=tryhtmlcss_intro)\n\n Click on the \"Try it Yourself\" button to see how HTML and CSS work together. \n\n Keep exploring\n\n Ready for more focused study?\n\n Check out the standalone tutorials:\n\n HTML Tutorial (https://www.w3schools.com/html/default.asp)\nCSS Tutorial (https://www.w3schools.com/css/default.asp)\n\n This integrated tutorial combines the best of both worlds so you can build real web projects faster.\n\n ❮ Home (https://www.w3schools.com/default.asp)\n Next ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/htmlcss/htmlcss_intro.asp)\n\n ★\n\n +1 (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fpathfinder.w3schools.com)\n\n REMOVE ADS (https://order.w3schools.com/plans)\n\n Learn more about Adventure Mode&rsaquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/adventure/)\n\n Free account\n\n Track your progress\n\n XP earned 0 \n Day streak 0 \n Spaces 0 \n League &mdash; \n\n Sign in to track progress (https://profile.w3schools.com/log-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmy-learning.w3schools.com)\n\n New\n\n Learn in Adventure Mode \n W3Schools Adventure App \n\n Coding fundamentals as bite-sized lessons and challen