t/rust_enums.php)\n\n Rust Cert\n\nRust Certificate (https://www.w3schools.com/rust/rust_exam.php)\n\n Rust Practice\n\nRust Practice Problems (https://www.w3schools.com/rust/rust_practice.php) \n\n Rust Tutorial \n\n❮ Home (https://www.w3schools.com/default.asp)\nNext ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/rust/rust_intro.php)\n\n Learn Rust\n\n Rust is a popular programming language used to build everything from web servers to game engines.\n\n Rust is known for being very fast, and is similar to C (https://www.w3schools.com/c/index.php) and C++ (https://www.w3schools.com/cpp/default.asp) in language.\n\n Learn Rust now ❯ (https://www.w3schools.com/rust/rust_intro.php)\n\n Become Rust Certified\n\n Get certified with our Rust exam, includes a professionally curated study kit to guide you from beginner to exam-ready.\n\nGet Certified ❯ (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/certifications/products/rust-certification-exam)\n\n Share \n\n Link Copied \n\n Examples in Each Chapter\n\n Our \"Try it Yourself\" editor makes it easy to learn Rust. You can edit code and view \nthe result in your browser:\n\n Example\n\n fn main() {\n println!(\"Hello World!\");\n}\n\nTry it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/rust/tryrust.php?filename=demo_helloworld)\n\n Click on the \"Try it Yourself\" button to see how it works.\n\n We recommend reading this tutorial, in the sequence listed in the left menu.\n\n Track Your Progress\n\n Create a W3Schools account and get access to more features and learning materials:\n\n View your completed tutorials, exercises, and quizzes\n\n Keep an eye on your progress and daily streaks\n\n Join the leaderboard and compete with others\n\n Get your own avatar and unlock new skins\n\n Create your own personal website\n\n Sign Up &raquo; (https://profile.w3schools.com/sign-up)\n\n Note\n\n This is an optional feature. You can study at W3Schools without creating an account.\n\n❮ Home w3schools.com (https://www.w3schools.com/default.asp)\nNext ❯ Rust In