om/plans)\n\n Where To Start\n Not sure where you want to start? Follow our guided path (https://www.w3schools.com/where_to_start.asp)\n\n Code Editor (Try it)\n With our online code editor, you can edit code and view the result in your browser (https://www.w3schools.com/tryit/default.asp)\n\n Templates\n We have created a bunch of responsive website templates you can use - for free! (https://www.w3schools.com/w3css/w3css_templates.asp)\n\n Web Hosting\n \n Host your own website, and share it to the world with\n W3Schools Spaces (https://www.w3schools.com/spaces/index.php)\n\n Create a Server\n Create your own server using Python, PHP, React.js, Node.js, Java, C#, etc. (https://www.w3schools.com/spaces/index.php)\n\n How To\'s\n Large collection of code snippets for HTML, CSS and JavaScript (https://www.w3schools.com/howto/default.asp)\n\n CSS Framework\n \n Build fast and responsive sites using our free\n W3.CSS\n framework (https://www.w3schools.com/w3css/default.asp)\n\n Videos\n Learn the basics of HTML in a fun and engaging video tutorial (https://www.w3schools.com/videos/index.php)\n\n Browser Statistics\n Read long term trends of browser usage (https://www.w3schools.com/browsers/default.asp)\n\n Typing Speed\n Test your typing speed (https://www.w3schools.com/typingspeed/default.asp)\n\n Color Picker\n \n Use our color picker to find different RGB, HEX and HSL colors. (https://www.w3schools.com/colors/colors_picker.asp)\n\n Newsletter\n Join our newsletter and get access to exclusive content every month (https://campus.w3schools.com/pages/newsletter)\n\n Emojis Reference\n \n Check out our refererence page with all the emojis supported in HTML\n \n  (https://www.w3schools.com/charsets/ref_emoji_intro.asp)\n\n Code Game\n \n W3Schools Coding Game! Help the lynx collect pine cones (https://www.w3schools.com/codegame/index.html)\n\n UTF-8 Reference\n Check out our full UTF-8 Character reference (https://www.w3schools.com/charsets/default.asp)\n\n Community\n Ch