://campus.w3schools.com/products/c-certificate-1)\n\n PHP example \n\n < !DOCTYPE html > \n\n < html > \n\n < body > \n\n <?php \n\n echo \"My first PHP script!\" ;\n\n ?> \n\n < /body > \n\n < /html > \n\n Try it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/php/phptryit.asp?filename=tryphp_intro)\n\n Learn PHP (https://www.w3schools.com/php/default.asp)\n PHP Reference (https://www.w3schools.com/php/php_ref_overview.asp)\n PHP Certificate (https://campus.w3schools.com/products/php-certificate)\n\n React example \n\n import { createRoot } from \'react-dom/client\' ;\n\n function Hello() { \n\n return (\n\n < h1 > Hello World! < /h1 > \n\n );\n\n } \n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById( \'root\' )).render( < Hello / > );\n\n Try it Yourself &raquo; (https://www.w3schools.com/react/showreact.asp?filename=demo2_react_test)\n\n Learn React (https://www.w3schools.com/react/default.asp)\n React Certificate (https://campus.w3schools.com/products/react-js-certificate)\n\n Example \n\n Try it Yourself &raquo; \n\n Learn \n Reference \n Certificate (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/certifications)\n\n All languages\n\n HTMLThe building blocks of every webpage (https://www.w3schools.com/html/default.asp)\n CSSStyle and layout for web pages (https://www.w3schools.com/css/default.asp)\n JavaScriptInteractive and dynamic web pages (https://www.w3schools.com/js/default.asp)\n SQLQuery and manage databases (https://www.w3schools.com/sql/default.asp)\n PythonPopular language for web, data & AI (https://www.w3schools.com/python/default.asp)\n JavaObject-oriented programming language (https://www.w3schools.com/java/default.asp)\n CA powerful general-purpose language (https://www.w3schools.com/c/index.php)\n C++The language behind games & engines (https://www.w3schools.com/cpp/default.asp)\n C#Build apps, games and web services (https://www.w3schools.com/cs/index.php)\n PHPServer-side scripting language (https://www.w3schools.com/php/default.asp)\nReact\n Build interactive user