3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/css-course)\n JavaScript (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/javascript-course)\n SQL (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/sql-course)\n Python (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/python-course)\n Java (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/java-course)\n C (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-c)\n C++ (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/cpp-course)\n C# (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/c-course)\n PHP (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/php-course)\n React (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/react-js-course)\n MySQL (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-mysql-1)\n Excel (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-excel)\n DSA (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-data-structures-and-algorithms)\n W3.CSS (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/certifications/products/w3-css-certificate)\n Bootstrap 3 (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/bootstrap-course)\n Bootstrap 4 (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/bootstrap-4-course)\n Bootstrap 5 (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-bootstrap-5)\n Node.js (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-node-js)\n TypeScript (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-typescript)\n Django (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-django)\n PostgreSQL (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/learn-postgresql)\n jQuery (https://campus.w3schools.com/collections/course-catalog/products/jquery-course)\n Vue (https://campu