at type of framework is Django?','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 09:33:52'),(714,32,7,81,'ASSISTANT','Based on the provided website excerpts, Django is a high-level Python web framework. Its key characteristics include:\n\n* It encourages rapid development and clean, pragmatic design.\n* It is designed to help developers build better web apps more quickly and with less code.\n* It helps developers take applications from concept to completion as quickly as possible (\"Ridiculously fast\").\n* It takes security seriously to help developers avoid many common security mistakes (\"Reassuringly secure\").\n* It is \"Exceedingly scalable.\"\n* It is free and open source.','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 09:33:56'),(715,38,7,26,'USER','Tell me about the hostel facilities and fee','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 09:34:14'),(716,38,7,26,'ASSISTANT','Based on the official website information, here are the details regarding the hostel facilities and fees:\n\n* **Hostel Facilities:** \n  * AC and Non-AC rooms available\n  * 24/7 Wi-Fi\n  * Laundry services\n  * Biometric security\n* **Hostel Fee:** \n  * The annual hostel fee is INR 85,000, which includes food.','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 09:34:15'),(717,32,7,81,'USER','What are the main benefits of using Django?','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 09:34:29'),(718,32,7,81,'ASSISTANT','Based on the provided website excerpts, the main benefits of using Django include:\n\n* **Speed and Efficiency:** It makes it easier to build better web apps more quickly and with less code, helping developers take applications from concept to completion rapidly (\"Ridiculously fast\").\n* **Reduced Hassle:** Built by experienced developers, it takes care of much of the hassle of web development so you can focus on writing your app without reinventing the wheel.\n* **Security:** It takes security seriously and helps developers avoid many common security mistakes (\"Reassuringly secure\").\n* **Scalability:** It is designed to be \"Exceedingly scalable.\"\n* **Design and Development Sty