uickly, with less code, and takes care of much of the hassle of web development so you can focus on writing your app without reinventing the wheel.','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:18:59'),(853,60,7,36,'USER','How does Django help developers with security?','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:19:09'),(854,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','Django helps developers with security by taking security seriously and helping them avoid many common security mistakes, such as:\n\n* SQL injection\n* Cross-site scripting\n* Cross-site request forgery\n* Clickjacking\n\nAdditionally, Django includes a user authentication system that provides a secure way to manage user accounts and passwords.','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:19:11'),(855,60,7,36,'USER','What is the personal mobile number of Django\'s project leader?','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:19:50'),(856,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','I am sorry, but specific details regarding the personal mobile number of Django\'s project leader are not available on the website. Please feel free to let me know if you would like me to connect you with a support team member or representative for further assistance.','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:19:51'),(857,60,7,36,'USER','Where can I get help from the Django community?','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:20:16'),(858,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','You can get help from the Django community through the following resources:\n\n* [Getting Help FAQ](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/stable/faq/)\n* [Django Discord](https://chat.djangoproject.com/)\n* [Official Django Forum](https://forum.djangoproject.com/)','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:20:17'),(859,60,7,36,'USER','hi','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:20:41'),(860,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','Hello! I am Jitu AI, the official virtual AI support assistant for Django. How can I help you today with Django web development, documentation, or community resources?','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:20:43'),(861,60,7,36,'USER','I just want to know about','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:20:52'),(862,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','It looks like your question was incomplete. Please provide more details about what you would like to know regarding Django, such as its community events, documentation, code repository, or technical governance.','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:20:55'),(863,60,7,36,'USER','where can I get help from the Jungle community','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:21:36'),(864,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','You can get help from the Django community through the following official resources:\n\n* [Getting Help FAQ](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/stable/faq/)\n* [Django Discord](https://chat.djangoproject.com/)\n* [Official Django Forum](https://forum.djangoproject.com/)','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:21:39'),(865,60,7,36,'USER','what resources does the official Gang of website provide','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:21:52'),(866,60,7,36,'ASSISTANT','The official Django website provides several main navigation resources:\n\n* [Overview](https://www.djangoproject.com/start/overview/)\n* [Download](https://www.djangoproject.com/download/)\n* [Documentation](https://docs.djangoproject.com/)\n* [News](https://www.djangoproject.com/weblog/)\n* [Code](https://github.com/django/django)\n* [Issues](https://code.djangoproject.com/)\n* [Community](https://www.djangoproject.com/community/)\n* [Foundation](https://www.djangoproject.com/foundation/)\n* [Donate](https://www.djangoproject.com/fundraising/)\n* [Sponsor](https://www.djangoproject.com/sponsor/)','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:21:56'),(867,32,7,81,'USER','what is jut','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:26:55'),(868,32,7,81,'ASSISTANT','JUT stands for Jharkhand University of Technology, located in Ranchi, Jharkhand. You can learn more about it by visiting the [About University Section](https://jutranchi.ac.in/?page_id=94).','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:26:57'),(869,32,7,81,'USER','jut admission process','SENT',NULL,'2026-10-03 11:27:07'),(870,32,7,81,'ASSISTANT','You can find information regarding admissions through the [Academics & Admission Section](https://jutranchi.ac.in/?page_id=3751). The 