"}','2026-10-03 11:43:38'),(887,66,7,81,'USER','How can someone get admission in M.Tech?','SENT','{\"source_fingerprint\": \"5de7dce32c029197eb94e353d0e11085a1586e7a44af8bd6625489a6042e3688\"}','2026-10-03 11:44:10'),(888,66,7,81,'ASSISTANT','To apply for admission in the M.Tech program (Academic Session 2026-28), you can fill out the application online using the [Online M.Tech. Application Filling Link](https://jutgyanjyoti.jharkhand.gov.in/). You can also review the [Notice regarding M.Tech. Admission](https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/M.-Tech.-Admission-Notice-l-1.pdf), the [M.Tech Admission Programmes 2026-28](https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/M.tech-admission-poster-7-1.pdf), and the [Advertisement of Admission Notice](https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Advt.-M.-Tech.-2026-27.pdf) for further details.','SENT','{\"source_fingerprint\": \"5de7dce32c029197eb94e353d0e11085a1586e7a44af8bd6625489a6042e3688\"}','2026-10-03 11:44:13'),(889,67,7,81,'USER','How can someone get admission in M.Tech?','SENT','{\"source_fingerprint\": \"5de7dce32c029197eb94e353d0e11085a1586e7a44af8bd6625489a6042e3688\"}','2026-10-03 11:44:28'),(890,67,7,81,'ASSISTANT','To apply for M.Tech admission for the academic session 2026-28, you can fill out the application online using the [Online M.Tech. Application Filling Link](https://jutgyanjyoti.jharkhand.gov.in/). You can also review the detailed admission notices and programs using the following links:\n\n- [Notice regarding M.Tech. Admission](https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/M.-Tech.-Admission-Notice-l-1.pdf)\n- [M.Tech Admission Programmes 2026-28 (updated)](https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/M.tech-admission-poster-7-1.pdf)\n- [Advertisement of Admission Notice Regarding M.Tech Session (2026-28)](https://jutranchi.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Advt.-M.-Tech.-2026-27.pdf)','SENT','{\"source_fingerprint\": \"5de7dce32c029197eb94e353d0e11085a1586e7a44af8bd6