answer\": \"Based on the provided documentation, props and state serve different roles in React components:\\n\\n* **Props**: React components use props to communicate with each other. Every parent component can pass information (such as JavaScript values, objects, arrays, functions, and JSX) down to its child components by giving them props.\\n* **State**: State is data held within a component (or lifted to a common parent component) that can change over time and trigger updates. State variables can be shared between components by \\\"lifting state up\\\" and passing that state down to children via props.\", \"turn_id\": \"turn-1791184504913-c06bbe0e\", \"suggestions\": [\"Passing Props\", \"Lifting State Up\", \"Managing State\"], \"follow_up_prompt\": \"Would you like to know more about passing props to a component or lifting state up?\", \"source_fingerprint\": \"3dc86e6666d7a5f236ea594bf10bb95726c2fa7538d7e755dc766aa1561e2feb\"}','2026-10-05 07:15:04'),(1464,16,7,36,'USER','okay buddy now tell me who is Varun','SENT','{\"source_fingerprint\": \"3dc86e6666d7a5f236ea594bf10bb95726c2fa7538d7e755dc766aa1561e2feb\"}','2026-10-05 07:15:14'),(1465,16,7,36,'ASSISTANT','I could not find any information about Varun in the available website excerpts. Would you like to connect with a support team member or representative for further assistance?\n\nWould you like to explore topics available on this website, such as React, React Versions, Quick Start?','SENT','{\"answer\": \"I could not find any information about Varun in the available website excerpts. Would you like to connect with a support team member or representative for further assistance?\", \"turn_id\": \"turn-1791184516041-05bdb429\", \"suggestions\": [\"What is React?\", \"What are React Versions?\", \"What is Quick Start?\"], \"follow_up_prompt\": \"Would you like to explore topics available on this website, such as React, React Versions, Quick Start?\", \"source_fingerprint\": \"3dc86e6666d7a5f236ea594bf10bb9572